: "## What's Changed\r\n* Credit Camille LaVey for the LSFG frame generation port by @maxjivi05 in https://github.com/WinNative-Emu/WinNative/pull/709\r\n* Feature Update Checker Implementation by @maxjivi05 in https://github.com/WinNative-Emu/WinNative/pull/707\r\n* Feature steam branch downloads by @maxjivi05 in https://github.com/WinNative-Emu/WinNative/pull/714\r\n* Stop repeating per-launch work that cannot change its own result by @maxjivi05 in https://github.com/WinNative-Emu/WinNative/pull/710\r\n* docs: update Dolphin core packaging by @Jovinull in https://github.com/WinNative-Emu/WinNative/pull/717\r\n* docs: fix canonical repository clone URL by @Jovinull in https://github.com/WinNative-Emu/WinNative/pull/716\r\n* Feature/itch.io by @maxjivi05 in https://github.com/WinNative-Emu/WinNative/pull/718\r\n* Fix Steam Launcher for Multiplayer/Networking/Cloud Saves by @maxjivi05 in https://github.com/WinNative-Emu/WinNative/pull/720\r\n* Add the DirectAudio driver, and with it microphone support by @maxjivi05 in https://github.com/WinNative-Emu/WinNative/pull/719\r\n* Fix/steam cloud sync by @maxjivi05 in https://github.com/WinNative-Emu/WinNative/pull/722\r\n* Support page added by @maxjivi05 in https://github.com/WinNative-Emu/WinNative/pull/725\r\n* Frame Gen for Retro by @maxjivi05 in https://github.com/WinNative-Emu/WinNative/pull/726\r\n* Add a release picker to the retro console bundle updater by @maxjivi05 in https://github.com/WinNative-Emu/WinNative/pull/724\r\n* fix misc bugs, performance, stability by @maxjivi05 in https://github.com/WinNative-Emu/WinNative/pull/723\r\n* misc fixes & device resolutions by @maxjivi05 in https://github.com/WinNative-Emu/WinNative/pull/728\r\n* fix: Steam Launcher toggle as per-shortcut setting by @Juan-Antonio-Doe in https://github.com/WinNative-Emu/WinNative/pull/729\r\n* Add DIS frame generation release by @qwertypower in https://github.com/WinNative-Emu/WinNative/pull/731\r\n* Fix RedMagic LSFG Pacing by @maxjivi05