ivi05 in https://github.com/WinNative-Emu/WinNative/pull/697 A special thank you to the Eden Development Team, whose original work on the Eden Emulator formed the foundation of this feature!\r\n\r\n## Bug Fixes\r\n* Fix non-ASCII game paths and ANSI code pages for shortcut launches by @kingokksa in https://github.com/WinNative-Emu/WinNative/pull/694\r\n* Center the Steam sign-in error inside the password field by @maxjivi05 in https://github.com/WinNative-Emu/WinNative/pull/702\r\n* Fix the Java formatting violations spotless reports by @maxjivi05 in https://github.com/WinNative-Emu/WinNative/pull/703\r\n* PS2 Portrait Issues by @maxjivi05 in https://github.com/WinNative-Emu/WinNative/pull/704\r\n* Show the frame generation input and output rate on the Mango HUD by @maxjivi05 in https://github.com/WinNative-Emu/WinNative/pull/705\r\n* Locate the Lossless DLL with WinNative's file picker by @maxjivi05 in https://github.com/WinNative-Emu/WinNative/pull/706\r\n\r\n## New Contributors\r\n* @kingokksa made their first contribution in https://github.com/WinNative-Emu/WinNative/pull/694\r\n\r\n**Full Changelog**: https://github.com/WinNative-Emu/WinNative/compare/v0.4.1...v0.5.0-beta", "reactions": {"url": "https://api.github.com/repos/WinNative-Emu/WinNative/releases/378068579/reactions", "total_count": 41, "+1": 15, "-1": 0, "laugh": 7, "hooray": 8, "confused": 0, "heart": 4, "rocket": 4, "eyes": 3}, "mentions_count": 2}]